### Variable Definitions
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@doctorToken = YOUR_DOCTOR_JWT_TOKEN
@patientToken = YOUR_PATIENT_JWT_TOKEN
@doctorId = YOUR_DOCTOR_UUID
@appointmentId = YOUR_APPOINTMENT_UUID

### 0.1 Register Doctor
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "stream.doctor@example.com",
  "password": "password123",
  "name": "Dr. Sarah Jenkins",
  "phone": "1234567890",
  "role": "doctor"
}

###

### 0.2 Login Doctor
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "stream.doctor@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

###

### 0.3 Create Doctor Profile (Set Stream Strategy)
POST {{baseUrl}}/doctor/profile
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{doctorToken}}

{
  "specialization": "Psychiatry",
  "yearsOfExperience": "10 years",
  "qualification": "MD, PhD",
  "bio": "Specializing in mood disorders and psychotherapy.",
  "schedulingType": "STREAM"
}

###

### 0.4 Register Patient
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "john.patient@example.com",
  "password": "password123",
  "name": "John Doe",
  "phone": "9876543210",
  "role": "patient"
}

###

### 0.5 Login Patient
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "john.patient@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

###

### 0.6 Create Patient Profile
POST {{baseUrl}}/patient/profile
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{patientToken}}

{
  "age": 32,
  "gender": "Male",
  "medicalHistory": "None"
}

###

### 1.1 Create Custom Date Availability (STREAM Strategy with Slot Duration & Buffer)
POST {{baseUrl}}/doctor/availability/override
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{doctorToken}}

{
  "date": "2026-08-15",
  "startTime": "10:00 AM",
  "endTime": "12:00 PM",
  "schedulingType": "STREAM",
  "slotDuration": 15,
  "bufferTime": 5,
  "isAvailable": true
}

###

### 1.2 Create Custom Date Availability (WAVE Strategy with Max Capacity)
POST {{baseUrl}}/doctor/availability/override
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{doctorToken}}

{
  "date": "2026-08-16",
  "startTime": "10:00 AM",
  "endTime": "11:00 AM",
  "schedulingType": "WAVE",
  "maxCapacity": 5,
  "isAvailable": true
}

###

### 2.1 Get Doctor Availability for Date (STREAM Strategy)
GET {{baseUrl}}/doctor/availability/date?date=2026-08-15&doctorId={{doctorId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{patientToken}}

###

### 2.2 Get Doctor Availability for Date (WAVE Strategy)
GET {{baseUrl}}/doctor/availability/date?date=2026-08-16&doctorId={{doctorId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{patientToken}}

###

### 3.1 Book STREAM Appointment (Exact Time Slot)
POST {{baseUrl}}/appointments/book
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{patientToken}}

{
  "doctorId": "{{doctorId}}",
  "date": "2026-08-15",
  "startTime": "10:00 AM",
  "endTime": "10:15 AM",
  "reason": "Routine Consultation"
}

###

### 3.2 Book WAVE Appointment (Capacity Token Assignment)
POST {{baseUrl}}/appointments/book
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{patientToken}}

{
  "doctorId": "{{doctorId}}",
  "date": "2026-08-16",
  "startTime": "10:00 AM",
  "endTime": "11:00 AM",
  "reason": "General Checkup"
}

###

### 4.1 Get Logged-in Patient Appointments
GET {{baseUrl}}/appointments/patient
Authorization: Bearer {{patientToken}}

###

### 4.2 Get Logged-in Doctor Appointments
GET {{baseUrl}}/appointments/doctor
Authorization: Bearer {{doctorToken}}

###

### 5.1 Patient Reschedule Appointment
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/appointments/{{appointmentId}}/reschedule
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{patientToken}}

{
  "newDate": "2026-08-15",
  "newStartTime": "10:20 AM",
  "newEndTime": "10:35 AM",
  "reason": "Rescheduled due to personal conflict"
}

###

### 5.2 Cancel Appointment (Patient Role -> Status: CANCELLED_BY_PATIENT)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/appointments/{{appointmentId}}/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{patientToken}}

###

### 5.3 Cancel Appointment (Doctor Role -> Status: CANCELLED_BY_DOCTOR)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/appointments/{{appointmentId}}/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{doctorToken}}
